{"schema_version":"1.2","task_id":"huangjiu-high-end-channel-20261015","execution_mode":"GITHUB_CHAT","status":"IN_PROGRESS","current_stage":"RESEARCH","next_action":"execute and persist RESEARCH","state_ref":"main","target_platforms":[],"distribution_mode":"DUAL","distribution_mode_source":"CANONICAL_ROUTING","delivery_channel":"WORD_FILE_ONLY","required_outputs":["AUDIT_DOCX","FINANCE_DEEP_DOCX","FINANCE_BROAD_DOCX"],"delivery_artifacts":{},"prompt":"# 从30元佐餐酒到1959元“国酿1959”，黄酒价格天花板被撬开，高端化第一步是让大商愿意卖\n\n2026/10/13 19:22\n\n方正证券研报指出，黄酒要翻身了，但靠的不是酒厂自己，是“白酒大商”来帮它卖。白酒这几年渠道利润被压得太狠——产量连降九年、价格倒挂、酒厂还一直压打款，大商手里有钱、有人脉、有品鉴团队，却找不到新东西卖。黄酒正好接住：认知度低、价格不透明，渠道毛利能到20%—30%，高端价格带还没被定义，等于“谁先来谁定规则”。酒厂也乐意：黄酒不缺品质，缺的是高端饭局上的“上桌机会”，大商正好能带它进高净值圈子。价格天花板已经打开：古越龙山“国酿1959”卖1959元/瓶、会稽山“大师兰亭”上千元，产地、年份、手工冬酿、不加焦糖色，可能成为高端黄酒的新标准。\n\n你做吧","source_refs":["https://gwlink.foundersc.com/infoResearchMacro/19006204.jhtml","https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-28/1225516863.PDF","https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-22/1225490354.PDF","https://money.finance.sina.com.cn/corp/view/vCB_AllBulletinDetail.php?id=12516522&stockid=601579","https://money.finance.sina.com.cn/corp/view/vCB_AllBulletinDetail.php?id=12568144&stockid=600616","https://finance.sina.com.cn/cj/2025-02-27/doc-inemwuer6705877.shtml","https://finance.sina.com.cn/cj/2025-02-23/doc-inemmtuu2252818.shtml","https://detail.youzan.com/show/goods?alias=3esx2865s7bes2d&from_source=gbox_seo","https://std.samr.gov.cn/gb/search/gbDetailedCNF?id=7643B2F250A0267CE05397BE0A0AAF6A"],"stage_artifacts":{},"review_decisions":{},"review_assurance":"CHAT_SELF_REVIEW","learning_evidence":[],"open_system_impact":[],"execution_receipts":[{"receipt_contract_version":"1.1","receipt_id":"receipt:69d4fcda-569c-4146-96e7-616624d31188","action_id":"huangjiu-high-end-channel-20261015:INIT:73072ec8-9f11-461e-b83c-d367355ea8ee","task_id":"huangjiu-high-end-channel-20261015","stage":"INTAKE","capability_id":"github_chat_workflow","executor_identity":"GPT-5.6-So